          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "REPORT OF INDEPENDENT CERTIFIED PUBLIC ACCOUNTANTS"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          139.86807039141422,
          386.85878267973857,
          11.188315025252564
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "To the Stockholders and the Board of Directors of Atrion Corporation:"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          163.42245391414144,
          842.8824718137255,
          11.188315025252564
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We have audited the accompanying consolidated balance sheets of Atrion Corporation (a Delaware corporation) and Subsidiaries as of December 31, 2003"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          177.65864267676784,
          844.1632361111112,
          11.188315025252336
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "and 2002, and the related consolidated statements of income, changes in stockholders’ equity and cash flows for the years then ended. These financial"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          191.894831439394,
          842.9142602124182,
          11.18831502525245
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "statements are the responsibility of the Company’s management. Our responsibility is to express an opinion on these financial statements based on our audit."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          206.13103314393936,
          843.9389587418302,
          11.188315025252564
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The financial statements of Atrion Corporation and Subsidiaries as of and for the year in the period ended December 31, 2001, were audited by other auditors"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          220.36722190656576,
          809.9531911764707,
          11.18831502525245
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "who have ceased operations. Those auditors expressed an unqualified opinion on those financial statements in their report dated February 25, 2002."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          243.92160542929298,
          844.3940620915032,
          11.188315025252564
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We conducted our audits in accordance with auditing standards generally accepted in the United States of America. Those standards require that we plan"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          258.15779419191915,
          844.148933006536,
          11.188315025252678
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "and perform the audit to obtain reasonable assurance about whether the financial statements are free of material misstatement. An audit includes"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          272.39398295454555,
          844.1712083333334,
          11.18831502525245
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "examining, on a test basis, evidence supporting the amounts and disclosures in the financial statements. An audit also includes assessing the accounting"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          286.6301717171717,
          844.3621732026143,
          11.188315025252678
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "principles used and significant estimates made by management as well as evaluating the overall financial statement presentation. We believe that our audits"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          300.866360479798,
          239.64912009803925,
          11.188315025252564
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "provide a reasonable basis for our opinion."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          324.4207569444445,
          844.3781176470588,
          11.18831502525245
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "In our opinion, the financial statements referred to above present fairly, in all material respects, the consolidated financial position of Atrion Corporation"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          338.6569457070708,
          844.180821895425,
          11.188315025252564
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "and Subsidiaries as of December 31, 2003 and 2002, and the consolidated results of their operations and their consolidated cash flows for the years then"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          352.893134469697,
          542.4805800653594,
          11.188315025252564
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "ended in conformity with accounting principles generally accepted in the United States of America."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          376.4475956439395,
          843.9484718137255,
          11.188276199494794
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "As discussed above, the financial statements of Atrion Corporation and Subsidiaries as of December 31, 2001, and for the year then ended were audited by"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          390.6837844065657,
          843.9675816993465,
          11.188276199494908
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "other auditors who have ceased operations. As described in Note 2, these financial statements have been revised to include the transitional disclosures required"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          404.91998611111114,
          843.9612508169935,
          11.188263257575727
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "by Statement of Financial Accounting Standards No. 142, Goodwill and Other Intangible Assets, which was adopted by the Company as of January 1, 2002. Our"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          419.1561748737374,
          843.9516372549019,
          11.188276199494908
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "audit procedures with respect to the disclosures in Note 2 with respect to 2001 included agreeing the previously reported net income to the previously issued"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          433.3923636363637,
          843.9326278594772,
          11.188276199494908
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "financial statements and the adjustments to reported net income representing amortization expense (including any related tax effects) recognized in those"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          447.6285523989899,
          844.0916870915034,
          11.188276199495022
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "periods related to goodwill to the Company’s underlying records obtained from management. We also tested the mathematical accuracy of the reconciliation"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          461.86474116161617,
          843.8371454248368,
          11.188276199495022
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "of adjusted net income to reported net income, and the related income-per-share amounts. In our opinion, the disclosures for 2001 in Note 2 are appropriate."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          476.10092992424245,
          843.8371454248368,
          11.188276199495022
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "However, we were not engaged to audit, review, or apply any procedures to the 2001 financial statements of the Company other than with respect to such"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          90.44117647058823,
          490.33711868686873,
          767.9577687908497,
          11.188276199494908
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Garamond-BookCondensed",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "disclosures and, accordingly, we do not express an opinion or any other form of assurance on the 2001 financial statements taken as a whole. "
      }
    ],
    [],
    [
